# What the xUSDC faucet adds on top of the stock fungible faucet: the attestation mint policy the
# stock `mint_and_send` dispatches to, and the attester allowlist setter that policy reads.
#
# The two procedures below are the whole of it. Everything the faucet can be asked to do from
# outside is either a stock component's procedure or one of these, so the account's surface is a
# decision recorded here rather than a side effect of which library procedure happens to carry the
# account-procedure attribute.

pub use {set_attester} from xreserve::attester_admin
pub use {check_policy} from xreserve::mint_policy
